<title>UK: Centrica to be part of FT/S&amp;P World Index.</title>
<headline>Centrica to be part of FT/S&amp;P World Index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrica Plc, the gas supply arm recently demerged from British Gas Plc, will be included in the calculation of the Financial Times/Standard &amp; Poor's World Index with effect from Monday, the index said.</p>
<p>Centrica, set to begin trading in London on Monday, consisted of British Gas' gas supply business in Britain, along with its Morecambe Bay gas fields off northwest England.</p>
<p>The rest of British Gas was renamed BG Plc.</p>
